'''Infernape ex''' (Japanese: '''ゴウカザルex''' ''Goukazaru ex'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 2 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

