==Trivia==
Infernape riding a cloud in the special illustration rare card may be a reference to {{wp|Monkey King}}—one of its supposed inspirations—who had an ability called Cloud Somersaulting (Chinese: 觔斗雲 ''Jīndǒuyún'') which allowed it to travel or "leap" 108,000 {{wp|li (unit)|li}} (54,000 km; 34,000 mi) in one somersault. Monkey King is often depicted as riding a nimbus-like cloud.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Infernape}}.
* {{m|Flare Blitz}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Infernape}} can learn.

